    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <member refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated_1gafc93799846770e521c4721d0de0a81cc" kind="function"><name>short_name</name></member>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ source file with implementations for the deprecated µTest++ definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the non-inline definitions of the deprecated definitions declared in <computeroutput><ref refid="deprecated_8h" kindref="compound">deprecated.h</ref></computeroutput>:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>reflection::short_name()</computeroutput>, which extracts the base file name from a fully qualified path, by delegating to <computeroutput>utility::extract_file_name()</computeroutput>;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the constructor of <computeroutput>detail::timestamp</computeroutput> that reads the system clock, with <computeroutput>detail::read_clock()</computeroutput>, the same clock as <computeroutput>detail::stopwatch</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
